{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-21","kind":"proposition","title":"任何立体角的平面角之和小于四个直角","englishTitle":"Any solid angle is contained by plane angles less than four right angles.","book":11,"number":21,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.21","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.21/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":21,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","contentId":"euclid-11-21","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c91c9d9e4cac807c955e4c97cfe44b25de6b2dde1f606fb1888727c1c029a8f0","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-21.statement","euclid-11-21.construction.1","euclid-11-21.construction.2","euclid-11-21.proof.1","euclid-11-21.proof.2","euclid-11-21.proof.3","euclid-11-21.proof.4","euclid-11-21.conclusion","euclid-11-21.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-21.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b81503bffc52576f794342d8c730c66444ccd4a1dce9649865f0fc9deb47e700","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Any solid angle is contained by plane angles less than four right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"构成任意立体角的各个平面角之和，小于四个直角之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63856b912f486841042bfd337b75d99ecdb6f31b384fda340f1ac2a1f2593050","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle at A be a solid angle contained by the plane angles BAC, CAD, DAB; I say that the angles BAC, CAD, DAB are less than four right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A角的角是一个平面角BAC,CAD,DAB的立体角;我说,BAC,CAD,DAB的角小于4,直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f508584fd08264c801434d8aa5801b04a4fd0ef18becc85629aeb97aebe9768","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let points B, C, D be taken at random on the straight lines AB, AC, AD respectively, and let BC, CD, DB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将B、C、D点分别随机放在AB、AC、AD直线上,BC、CD、DB点连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c84108b586e7d96f4e4e97801b09520421d866c1e003365b6b1fe6726b28b49a","citations":["euclid-11-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the solid angle at B is contained by the three plane angles CBA, ABD, CBD, any two are greater than the remaining one; [[XI. 20](/principles/euclid-11-20)] therefore the angles CBA, ABD are greater than the angle CBD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,B的固体角由3 平面角度 CBA,ABD,CBD组成, 任何两个角度都比其余的更大。 因此,CBA,ABD角度大于CBD角度。 [[XI. 20](/principles/euclid-11-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42fbd9dfe961b6c1c8f9cf668f7fdb61c81a9a6f380328d3c52e92065d298b9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angles BCA, ACD are also greater than the angle BCD, and the angles CDA, ADB are greater than the angle CDB; therefore the six angles CBA, ABD, BCA, ACD, CDA, ADB are greater than the three angles CBD, BCD, CDB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,BCA、ACD角度也大于BCD角度,CDA、ADB角度大于CDB角度;因此,6个角度CBA、ABD、BCA、ACD、ADB、ADB角度大于338、BCD、CDB角度。（相关点与线段：CBD）"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f60820888111e22d2b5fbb7cb856ca0bd141af0a70822f5b9aac06c1e461a27","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the three angles CBD, BDC, BCD are equal to two right angles; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the six angles CBA, ABD, BCA, ACD, CDA, ADB are greater than two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但三个角度是CBD,BDC,BCD等于2,直角;因此,六个角度是CBA,ABD,BCA,ACD,CDA,ADB大于2,直角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1e7bd32674101582facc4f2a9ae9ddacb3e4b4e97ba87bd63134ef508779d17d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the three angles of each of the triangles ABC, ACD, ADB are equal to two right angles, therefore the nine angles of the three triangles, the angles CBA, ACB, BAC, ACD, CDA, CAD, ADB, DBA, BAD are equal to six right angles; and of them the six angles ABC, BCA, ACD, CDA, ADB, DBA are greater than two right angles; therefore the remaining three angles BAC, CAD, DAB containing the solid angle are less than four right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于三角形中每个三角形的三个角度为ABC,ACD,ADB等于2,直角,因此,三个三角形的九个角度,即CBA,ACB,BAC,ACD,CDA,CAD,ADB,DBA,BAD等于6,直角;其中六个角度为ABC,BCA,ACD,CDA,ADB,DBA大于2,直角;因此,其余三个角度(即BAC,CAD,DAB),包含立体角的第三个角度小于4,直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-21.source","contentId":"euclid-11-21","revisionId":"euclid-11-21@raw-c91c9d9e4cac807c","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95167339506b277bde56b9ddba162786936d760c43f4694b901de692cdeb3ef9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.21/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.21\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-21:euclid-11-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-21","